* How riskdep detects\nan incident
** Three detectors
*** Events in a block
*** State differences between reads
*** Standing findings at start-up
** Timing
*** Poll 12 s, 2 confirmations
*** About 24 to 36 s after the block
*** Full read every 25 blocks, refresh 300
** Price
*** Oracle move >= 5 %
*** Divergence from market >= 3 %
*** Feed band at start-up
** Solvency
*** Unrealised bad debt 0.01 % / 0.1 %
*** Liquidation curve
*** Bad debt realised, pending loss
*** Drain window d*
left side
** Issuer and token
*** Mint >= 5 % of supply
*** Pause, upgrade, owner change
** Governance
*** Submit with no notice: critical
*** Timelock queue: CallScheduled
*** Abdicated exit gates
** Liquidity and exit
*** Utilisation >= 99 %
*** Exit queue, gates
** OracleImpact
*** Fall >= 2 %: loss now, liquidatable
*** Depositor's loss and verdict
*** Fork: 215,003 stated, 217,286 realised
** Not detected
*** Off-chain before publication
*** Mempool, other chains
*** A frozen feed (FeedStale planned)
@endmindmap
